/T (Our Experience: SHPE National Convention is the largest gathering of Hispanics in STEM in the country. In 2026, SHPE National will celebrate its 52th anniversary in Indianapolis, Indiana. At the Convention, our members will have access to dozens of professional and academic development workshops, be able to network with thousands of peers and corporate representatives from across the country, and have the opportunity to secure employment at a career fair with over 300 companies.)
