/E (TAMU SHPE is delighted by the prospect of your company joining our SHPE Familia as a corporate sponsor. As a sponsor, your company will receive inside access to our organization, which comes with the opportunity to market and recruit from a pool of highly talented and diverse individuals. Our membership consists of students from various engineering disciplines and other concentrations such as business, agriculture, mathematics, and more.)
/Pg 19 0 R
