464 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 201 0 R
/E (TAMU SHPE has much to offer, and the journey we embark on each year can seem overwhelming for a student-led society. However, through the support of our dedicated sponsors and membership, we embrace the challenges we face and see our goals through to the end. For 32 years, TAMU SHPE has consistently introduced quality graduates into the workforce who exemplify outstanding merit, integrity, and credibility. Through leadership opportunities such as the executive board, committee representatives, and other committee positions, our members are empowered to create a lasting impact at Texas A&M and the world. As a sponsor, your contributions extend beyond TAMU SHPE. Our chapter is involved with other societies and organizations at Texas A&M, allowing all Aggies to benefit from your efforts. The invaluable experiences made possible by being a part of TAMU SHPE pay dividends for years to come)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
