/Title (Since 1994, TAMU SHPE has thrived as a premiere, student-led engineering organization.  As leaders in the Hispanic and engineering community, we do not take our role lightly.  We are driven by our ambition to enable future generations of successful students, engineers, and professionals.  At TAMU SHPE, we cultivate an atmosphere conducive to interaction between professionals and students who embrace the values of the SHPE familia.  Additionally, our chapter executes a wide array of important responsibilities that hold true to the Aggie Spirit.  Given our national status as a large chapter, our reach and capabilities are extensive.  This enables TAMU SHPE to successfully serve individuals across all levels of academia: from elementary to the collegiate level, and beyond.)
